## Financial Analysis

### Current State

Litware Terminal Services is on a steep growth trajectory. FY2025 revenue reached $55.6M (up 25.2% from $44.3M in FY2024), with EBITDA of $24.2M and a 43.6% EBITDA margin [1]. The FY2026 budget projects $78M in revenue, $39.5M in EBITDA (50.6% margin), and $22.2M in net income [4] — implying continued strong operating leverage.

