| FY2025 Gross Margin | 46.7% | 51.3% (full-year) / 46.7% (Q1 2026) | Company P&L [1][26] |
| FY2026 Projected EBITDA | $39.5M | $39.5M | FY2026 Budget [4] |
| Equipment Utilization | 100% | 100% (confirmed by multiple leaders) | Stakeholder Interviews [3] |

